<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Life to invest Y100-200 bln foreign bonds.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Life to invest Y100-200 bln foreign bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Life Insurance Co plans 100 billion to 200 billion yen worth of new investment in foreign bonds in the second half of the current fiscal year, a company official told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It also plans 400 billion to 500 billion yen worth of new investment in domestic bonds in the same period, he added.</p>
